# Files that live in the repo but must never be served.
#
# Vercel serves this repo's root directory as the site, so anything committed
# here is a public URL whether or not it is linked or in the sitemap. These are
# internal engineering notes: they were reachable at sixthdegree.app/*.md,
# unlinked but crawlable, and they still carry the emoji-and-dash house style
# the public copy deliberately dropped.
#
# .vercelignore keeps them out of the deployment without deleting them from the
# repo, so the team keeps the docs and the public site does not.
DESIGN-REVIEW.md
VERIFICATION.md

# Build tooling and sources for the generated blog. The generated HTML in
# blog/ is what ships; these are the inputs.
scripts/
content/

# Local development noise.
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json
